{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita","level":"B1","topic":"Nomen","title":{"de":"Komposita","bn":"Compound nouns: একাধিক শব্দ মিলে একটি noun"},"summary":"Arbeit + Zimmer → das Arbeitszimmer; gender আসে শেষের noun থেকে।","sections":[{"heading":"Compound nouns","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"German-এ দুই বা তার বেশি শব্দ মিলে একটি নতুন noun তৈরি হতে পারে।"},{"kind":"list","items":["Arbeit + Zimmer → Arbeitszimmer — কাজের ঘর","Haus + Tür → Haustür — বাড়ির দরজা","Deutsch + Kurs → Deutschkurs — জার্মান ভাষার কোর্স","Führerschein — ড্রাইভিং লাইসেন্স"]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখো: Compound noun-এর gender সাধারণত শেষের noun থেকে নির্ধারিত হয়।"},{"kind":"text","text":"das Arbeitszimmer-এ শেষ শব্দ Zimmer, তাই das।"}]}],"part":3,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Compound noun-এর gender কোথা থেকে আসে?","options":["প্রথম noun থেকে","শেষের noun থেকে","সবসময় das"],"answer":1,"explanation":"শেষের noun থেকে।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Arbeitszimmer (das Zimmer)","options":["der","die","das"],"answer":2,"explanation":"শেষ শব্দ Zimmer → das Arbeitszimmer।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Haustür (die Tür)","options":["die","das","der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"শেষ শব্দ Tür → die Haustür।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Deutschkurs (der Kurs)","options":["das","der","die"],"answer":1,"explanation":"শেষ শব্দ Kurs → der Deutschkurs।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Haus + Tür → ?","options":["Türhaus","Haustür","Haus-Tür"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Haus + Tür → Haustür (বাড়ির দরজা)।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Führerschein“ মানে কী?","options":["ড্রাইভিং লাইসেন্স","বাড়ির দরজা","কাজের ঘর"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Führerschein = ড্রাইভিং লাইসেন্স।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-komposita","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-komposita-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Compound noun-এর gend